			},
			"date": "2023-06-06T18:03:51.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> I do. Much like Walkmans initially had a “unsociable, for the rich, why would anyone want that, how rude”… this will be the same. Mainstream in households in a decade. No one batting an eye about wearing them. Later, cheap enough for all. Then, spatial computing will have revolutionised society just like smart phones have.</p>",
