			"date": "2023-06-06T18:20:32.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> the first computers were something that only universities could afford. </p><p>products can be revolutionary while being expensive </p><p>meta quest being more affordable doesn't make it revolutionary by default</p><p>affordable and revolutionary aren't mutually exclusive</p>",
