			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@dvngnt\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>dvngnt</span></a></span> I think the intention behind the original quote is that things are not revolutionary until they are accessible</p>",
