			"date": "2023-06-06T18:38:27.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> i don't use mac products because i don't like being locked into their ecosystem</p><p>but what i do like about apple is they do drive the industry forward and other companies will try to follow them.</p><p>Using a valve index for the past 2 years looking for a good pcvr upgrade. I imagine this will light a fire under the med-big tech companies</p>",
