			"date": "2023-06-06T23:00:00.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://mstdn.social/@mattwilcox\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>mattwilcox</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> </p><p>\"Especially when i was working in VR games as a QA tester, you would be in the headset anywhere from four to eight hours a day with essentially two small tv screens blaring into your eyes. It's worth noting that vr manufacturers actually suggest players only stick to like 30 to 60 minutes a day. I personally have long term eye vision damage from that experience.\"</p><p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/T5WkRtJXlEM?t=74\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"\">youtu.be/T5WkRtJXlEM?t=74</span><span class=\"invisible\"></span></a></p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "110499757081145077",
			"parentId": "110499751720641282",
			"url": "https://mastodon.social/@JamesWidman/110499757052146225",
			"author": {
				"name": "James Widman",
				"url": "https://mastodon.social/@JamesWidman",
				"avatarUrl": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/avatars/original/missing.png"
			},
			"date": "2023-06-06T23:01:24.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://mstdn.social/@mattwilcox\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>mattwilcox</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> on top of that, apple is encouraging people to use this both at work and at home. </p><p>Which means work will eventually depend on it. </p><p>So a lot of people are going to develop new visual disabilities.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
