			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.world/@exchgr\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>exchgr</span></a></span> Sure, all innovations are invalidated because they weren’t free the day they were released.</p><p>Computers, cell phones, laptops, smart phones. None of them were innovations.</p>",
